From b89af640e4558a2233e3924729a26c66d8c120d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: boromyr <52782032+boromyr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:33:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Merge pfalstad/circuitjs1#290: color MOSFET and op-amp by
 operating region

MOSFET channel and op-amp body colored by operating region, toggled by
Other Options > Show Operating Region (off by default), by esaruoho.

Conflict resolution in EditOptions.java: options are indexed by number,
and master added Matrix Solver and Value Label Font Size after the PR's
base. Final order: 15 Show Operating Region, 16 Auto-Adjust Timestep,
17 Matrix Solver, 18 Value Label Font Size, 19 minimum time step.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/com/lushprojects/circuitjs1/client/CircuitElm.java b/src/com/lushprojects/circuitjs1/client/CircuitElm.java
