From c96be1da19f5dc1ba4e718a274b36c09901e9ffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: boromyr <52782032+boromyr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:33:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Merge pfalstad/circuitjs1#385: add thermoelectric (Peltier)
 element with thermal ports

PeltierElm with electrical and thermal terminals, plus TEC/TEG example circuits, by esaruoho.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

